# @knittotextile/knitto-mysql

## Sumber kebenaran API

**WAJIB baca** sebelum menulis query atau mutasi DB:

- `node_modules/@knittotextile/knitto-mysql/README.md`
- Repo: https://github.com/knittotextile/knitto-mysql

Connection proyek: [`src/libs/config/mysqlConnection.ts`](../../src/libs/config/mysqlConnection.ts) (atau path setara di `src/libs/config/`).

## Layering proyek

| Layer | Tanggung jawab |
|-------|----------------|
| **`queries/*.queries.ts`** | SELECT saja — tanpa INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE |
| **`repo/*.repo.ts`** | Mutasi DB — `extends BaseRepository`, per proses bisnis |

Aturan lengkap: [`boilerplate.mdc`](boilerplate.mdc). Snippet: skill `feature-scaffold/examples/` (`query.snippet.md`, `repository.snippet.md`).

## Migration schema

File SQL di folder [`database/`](../../../database/) — **apply manual**; tidak ada runner otomatis di repo.

Playbook: skill [`db-migration`](../../skills/db-migration/SKILL.md).

## Larangan proyek

- SELECT di `repo/` (pakai `queries/`)
- Repository per-tabel (satu repo = satu proses bisnis)
- CTE dan `ROW_NUMBER()` dalam SQL
- Try-catch di queries/repo (throw ke `requestHandler`)
